# Where the ad-hoc fidelity comparison drops its stills, montages and heat maps.
# Megabytes of derived images, regenerated by `just inspect` whenever they are
# wanted.
/inspect-out

# Recordings burned by hand at the repo root. A tape names its own output, and
# a checked-in one goes stale the first time the renderer changes — the golden
# fixtures under `tests/golden` are the ones that are meant to be tracked, so
# the pattern is anchored to the root rather than applied everywhere.
/*.mp4
/*.png
/*.svg
/*.svgz
